{\pard\sa120 We will prepare your 2025 federal Form 1040 and your Utah resident return from the information you give us, including Schedule C for Fonoti Landscape & Stone, LLC (EIN 87-3340918). We will not audit or verify your records. We may ask you to explain items that look incomplete or inconsistent.\par}
{\pard\sa120 You told us that Mele's son from her first marriage, Sione (born August 3, 2011), lived with you all year and that his father has agreed in writing not to claim him. Please send us the signed Form 8332. Without it we cannot claim the child tax credit for him.\par}
